  m_text: 'Dodge Obstacles with WASD.


    Peck (attack) your enemy with Space and make them lose HP (health points).


    Depleting your own health will reset the fight


    Dodge without pecking to build up RP (respect points).


    Win the fight by filling the enemy''s RP meter or depleting their HP meter.


    Press the ? block to open this window anytime. '
